      en: ["Central town located in the Thaba-Tseka District", "Home to St. James Hospital, established in the 1960s", "Important trading post for mohair wool and livestock", "Situated along the strategic A3 east-west road link", "Surrounded by the Maloti Mountains and alpine landscapes", "Serves as a regional educational hub with several schools"],
