      en: ["Elevation exceeds 2200 meters above sea level.", "Located on the primary route to Mohale Dam.", "Administratively part of the Maseru District.", "Vital center for highland livestock grazing.", "Linked to the Highlands Water Project.", "Defined by rugged basaltic mountain geography."],
